  CVE-2026-32928|2026-04-01T23:17:03.267|2026-04-01T23:17:03.267|8.4|HIGH|CWE-121|N/A|false|V-SFT versions 6.2.10.0 and prior contain a stack-based buffer overflow in VS6ComFile!CSaveData::_conv_AnimationItem. Opening a crafted V7 file may lead to arbitrary code execution on the affected product.|https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-32928|0.00015|0.03054|5.8804
  CVE-2026-32927|2026-04-01T23:17:03.110|2026-04-01T23:17:03.110|8.4|HIGH|CWE-125|N/A|false|V-SFT versions 6.2.10.0 and prior contain an out-of-bounds read vulnerability in VS6MemInIF!set_temp_type_default. Opening a crafted V7 file may lead to information disclosure from the affected product.|https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-32927|0.00013|0.02148|5.8804
